<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:09.360
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.900
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.240
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>toki ga mirai ni susumu to dare ga kimeta no da?</i>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<b>Who decided that time should move forward towards the future?</b>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<i>rakuin o kesu inochi ga rekishi o kakinaosu</i>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<b>The lives that will erase these brands will rewrite history</b>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<i>utsukushii tsurugi wa hito to hito tsunagete</i>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<b>People are connected by beautiful, double-edged swords</b>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<i>meguri kuru setsuna sa kanashimi wo aratte</i>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>Our coming anticipation will wash away our sadness</b>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<i>anata to no aida ni inochi aru katachi wo</i>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<b>With you, between us, life is formed</b>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<i>Kono hoshi ni sasageru ai to iu shirushi de</i>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<b>With the proof called "love" that we offer to this planet</b>

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:06.080
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:06.580
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:07.580
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.080
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.210
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.590
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:14.090
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:14.590
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.590
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.180
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.680
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:25.720
<i>Lady Kihel is a gentle person.</i>

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:29.610
<i>In addition, Milady Sochie is as well.</i>

00:01:29.610 --> 00:01:33.230
<i>They both grieved over the death of Will Game, a warrior whose life was extinguished in battle.</i>

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:37.610
<i>Furthermore, that Teteth Halleh has somehow disappeared as well.</i>

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:41.400
<i>I'm quite concerned about it.</i>

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:49.040
<b>Dust Blows On The Founding Of A Nation</b>

00:01:56.150 --> 00:01:57.430
It keeps flashing!

00:01:57.430 --> 00:01:58.720
It's only lightning!

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:01.140
The Militia isn't using a secret weapon?

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:03.140
Do you really believe the Militia could produce such a thing?

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:06.020
Why'd you decide to take us there on a day like this?

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.730
Exactly because it is like this.

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:09.430
Watch out!

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:15.860
Since there's a nasty storm like this, the Luzianna Militia won't be conducting its hunt for Moonrace members.

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:19.410
What happens if we are captured by the Luzianna Militia?

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:23.330
I would presume we'd be executed. You are their enemy.

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:25.610
Look out! The trees!

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:28.540
We'll be killed...

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:30.620
That's just lightning striking an object near here.

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:33.710
Isn't that just as bad as being hit by a beam weapon?

00:02:45.870 --> 00:02:47.310
That scared me!

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.800
Who'd have thought this thing was lightning proof?

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:54.070
Keith, there you are.

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:56.610
Smoke's coming off the White Doll?

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:58.810
It was hit by lightning.

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:12.120
Whose car is that?

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:14.210
Perhaps Lady Lalah of Luzianna?

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:16.130
The Luzianna leader's daughter?

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:18.550
Keep up the good work, Inglessa soldiers.

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:21.920
- Thank you very much!
- And the same to you!

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:25.710
Her name's Lily Borjarno!

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:35.020
Just as you requested, I'll lend you my power.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:38.530
So does that mean I've given you the help you needed, Sir Guin?

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:43.320
I've asked White Doll to protect the Moonrace technicians that we've hired.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:46.530
But does that Mechanical Doll still follow your orders, Sir Guin?

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:50.120
It did back when the Militia still listened to me.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:52.410
Right, Colonel Michael?

00:03:56.770 --> 00:03:59.880
You should consider shifting your attack to this position.

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:04.220
If l can take control of the newly found Mountain Cycle....

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:08.140
l believe l could more efficiently increase our troops.

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:12.600
Where does all this confidence of yours come from, Sir Guin?

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:15.720
That was rather rude of you, Mr. Colonel.

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:20.360
Do you still think I'm a man living off of my father's legacy?

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:23.110
l know you are a business man...

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:27.120
But when it comes to those machines, there is no choice but to bring in technicians.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:31.580
I'll just hold the horses reigns a bit more tightly to ensure we won't be betrayed.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:34.530
Thank you for hearing me out.

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:40.000
What is that?

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:43.130
My father received these letters, addressed to "Sir Guin".

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:45.010
I've brought them here for you.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.840
Feel free to take a look at them.

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:50.640
The sender is "Dianna Soriel."

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:51.810
Please, let me see those!

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:53.730
But you'll have to catch me first!

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:55.020
Don't try to be cute...

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:57.100
- I'm over here.
- Come on stop it.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:05:00.320
What? Don't you remember? This is payback for the days when we were kids.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:02.320
Over here, No, here!

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:03.240
Quit playing around!

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.740
I'm not playing, I'm totally serious!

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:10.410
I've also received letters that are addressed to Sir Guin.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.540
The Colonel as well?

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:15.120
It appears there are still many people who need you, Sir Guin.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:18.000
This was sent by Dianna Soriel.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:21.340
l could not imagine why so many letters would be sent in my name.

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:23.630
A Ceremony for Declaring the founding of a fiefdom?!

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.130
Founding of a fiefdom?

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:26.130
Who?

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:27.640
It was signed as sent from Dianna Counter.

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:29.300
How is that possible?

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.510
Then... Is this one also...

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:34.680
The same envelope and the same invitation.

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:37.020
Mind if I open it?

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:38.600
Go ahead.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:42.020
It says that the Sunbelt area will be ruled over by the Diana Counter.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.230
This is garbage!

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.030
Don't do that, Lily Borjarno.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.110
What do you mean?

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:48.490
Even if the Sunbelt area has no connection with Luzianna...

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:50.030
If we were to allow this...

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:53.540
...even our domain would eventually fall to Dianna Counter.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:56.240
That's a natural reaction to this development...

00:05:56.760 --> 00:06:00.830
This order... was approved by a girl of earth's population, Kihel?

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:04.410
Or could she have been coerced by Miran and the others?

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:20.440
Jacop, go and get the WaD team over here!

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:29.320
Bruno, I can't take this anymore!

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:31.020
Those idiots!

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:33.900
Do they think we're going to take this!?

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:45.200
My goodness, what's the point of making those useless mobile suits do all the work?

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:49.010
The pilots of those Mobile Suits...

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:50.920
...aren't they acting cute?

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:57.100
Invitations to the "Declaration of founding a fiefdom"...

00:06:57.100 --> 00:07:02.100
have been sent anyone we could contact who is connected to Rhineford.

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.820
We've been unable to locate him since the destruction of Nocis.

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:06.820
That's all that can be done.

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:08.110
Yes.

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.320
At ease, officer.

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:12.320
Queen Dianna, you can't enter the bridge right now!

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:13.410
What are you talking about?

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.530
It's like we're being attacked by a beam cannon out there!

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:17.320
A beam cannon?

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:23.330
On earth, large gusts of dust can produce lightning like what you see.

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:26.170
Wouldn't the Soleil have a lightning rod to protect it?

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:30.800
The Earth's weather patterns may be stronger than the Moon's artificial ones...

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:33.010
But this storm isn't a reason for concern.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:34.800
- It won't affect us?
- Correct.

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:36.600
Over there, it's a tornado!

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:39.810
Why you! You dare to interrupt Lady Dianna!?

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:45.510
- Get the Mobile Suits to hold down our tents!
- WaDom, secure the steel beams!

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:02.830
It's no good! I can't take it!

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:05.830
This storm must be some bizarre curse the people of earth wished on us!

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:07.840
It's gonna kill us all!

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:10.340
He's hysterical. Get him to our medical wing.

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:11.420
Yes...

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:12.300
But...

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.430
Some kind of curse?

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:14.930
This is a serious matter.

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:20.520
The condition outside may be dangerous, but it's not nearly as bad as the moon's deadly vacuum. The two can't be compared.

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:23.730
The Moonrace simply fears a natural occurrence it can't yet understand.

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:25.730
l would like to speak to the people.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:27.110
What's that?

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:29.230
l must reach the other ship where our soldiers reside.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:33.560
In order to reassure them that it's impossible for the people of earth to summon a storm like this upon us.

00:08:33.560 --> 00:08:35.280
Queen Dianna?

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:38.330
A Tornado can come and go in only a few minutes.

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:39.910
But you can't go out to meet them now!

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:42.320
l can't let them be blinded by mindless superstitions.

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:50.340
What are they having us seek out Colonel Michael for?

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:55.130
I know. Scouring the landscape for someone's scent isn't what I signed up for.

00:08:55.350 --> 00:08:57.640
l heard that, you two.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.340
I'm sorry, sir!

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:03.050
But where could Lieutenant Mallygan be?

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:05.300
Commander Gavane, can you see that?

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:14.860
Don't move even a little bit! I don't want our trucks to be knocked in the river!

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:21.320
Well picking you up one by one and carrying you across would've taken even longer, so please hurry up and get across.

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:36.260
That's really terrible. I never realized that blowing dust could destroy a bridge like that.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:39.300
Actually, it was bombed by Dianna Counter.

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:40.720
Is that what happened?

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:43.520
Those are Luzianna's Mobile Suits!

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:44.930
Luzianna?

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:47.730
Are they the people on the hunt for other Moonrace members?

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:51.720
It's rather strange that they've been sent way out here to hunt for the Moonrace.

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:55.150
l am Loran Cehack.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.820
That's odd.

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:58.740
When the pilot was a girl, it was just Sochie.

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:02.530
Yet when I expected to find "Laura Rola", it's really just a man named Loran.

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:06.210
So where did the mechanical doll pilot "Laura Rola" end up going?

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:09.830
I don't know. The press just reported whatever rumors they heard.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.920
Whatever.

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:14.090
So who's in that truck team you're escorting?

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:16.220
They came with me to build another bread factory.

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:19.930
We organized this with what we had left from Nocis. Just a few fisherman and butchers.

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:21.720
They're evacuees, just evacuees.

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:23.430
You may have some Moonrace members mixed in with you.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.270
Nonsense, that's impossible.

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:28.230
l think a few of them could have slipped by you.

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:30.730
Do we look like we're that stupid?

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:32.520
There's a whole lot of 'em here.

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.610
We should bring them back to the base for investigation.

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:39.320
l have an important appointment with the owner out here. I can't afford to miss it!

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:42.700
Alright then, I have an idea. Let's test your strength in a spar against my Borjarnon.

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:45.200
If you win, I'll leave you be.

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:48.120
Is "Borjarnon" your mechanical doll?

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:51.000
Interesting, I'd also like to see who's stronger.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:53.210
I don't think that's necessary...

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:56.120
Hmph. It's the best compromise I can offer.

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:01.720
Wait up! You'll be my dinner!

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:03.930
Bruno, are you angry?

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:05.180
Why?

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:09.100
I figured we'd finally be happy once Sergeant Corin disappeared.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:12.810
Who would've known that Dianna Counter would suddenly treat us so coldly?

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:17.110
They acted like elites and treated us like garbage!

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:20.150
Don't waste your energy, it'll only make you hungry.

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:22.730
I'm already hungry...

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:26.200
Are you ready?

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:28.820
"Laura" or "Loran", or whoever you are?

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:34.030
I still don't understand why we have to do this.

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:42.510
The earth people even fight amongst themselves?

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:44.720
Watch what you say.

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:48.720
If Loran loses, we'll be sent to Luzianna.

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:54.730
Watch this one closely, men of Luzianna!

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:56.400
Smack that mustached jerk!

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:58.030
Go for it, Loran!

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:00.100
Come on, White Doll!

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:05.610
- I was wondering what all the noise was from.
- The Mustached machine is fighting, right?

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:23.340
If we lose, will we really be taken away?

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:25.720
Don't worry, he'll win.

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:27.550
It's meat, Bruno, meat!

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:30.260
An entire truck full of it!

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:42.070
What? The White Doll's reaction time is lower?

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:43.530
Will I not be able to beat him?

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:46.020
I knew you'd have weak defense the first time I saw you!

00:12:47.590 --> 00:12:50.440
Come on, go for it, White Doll!

00:12:57.980 --> 00:13:01.120
Chief, use your legs, your legs!

00:13:04.270 --> 00:13:06.630
ls he okay?

00:13:07.190 --> 00:13:09.050
Our truck!?

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:12.140
Thief!

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:13.230
The meat was stolen!

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:15.050
Thief?

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:17.580
Are you running away?

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:21.320
This is a fight between men with mechanical dolls. Do you intend to run away?

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:24.320
You don't understand, This is about survival!

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:28.280
The people on those trucks didn't come here to act as spies for anyone!

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:32.450
Then we'll just take the people in the trucks and use them as hostages, right!?

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:34.540
What do you intend to do with hostages?

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:38.710
Is the Suicide Squad abusing civilians?

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:40.420
Lady Lily Borjarno!

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:42.050
Why are you here?

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:43.550
We're in a war!

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:47.250
Why are you playing juvenile games, Gavane Gooney!? Show yourself!

00:13:47.780 --> 00:13:49.970
What are you doing our here by the front lines, Princess!?

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:53.350
I'm here to deal with whatever aggressive tricks you people are trying to pull!

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:56.440
It's because of your actions that I had to come out here in the first place!

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:59.930
If it weren't for you, I could be spending my time with Sir Guin right now!

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:09.030
Those damned politicians. Ever since I lost my part in the negotiations, no progress was made at all. I can't believe they'd be this irresponsible.

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:14.330
Miss Kihel doesn't seem to have either the power or ability to solve this current situation...

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:17.240
l can see that very clearly now.

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:21.420
Before the ceremony, l have to find a way to speak with Ambassador Miran or Lieutenant Harry.

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:24.550
No, it must to be with Dianna Soriel.

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:26.750
We must speak to that woman.

00:14:27.690 --> 00:14:31.050
In the little time that we've spent apart, Kihel, you've changed.

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:32.220
Is that so?

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:33.930
You've become much stronger.

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:37.050
Your determination helps me feel at ease.

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:41.650
Meat, meat! Yahoo!

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:43.640
We did it!

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:48.030
Crap! The Mustached one's tracking us down!

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:50.320
He's pretty persistent.

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:52.360
Head into the forest.

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:57.650
I'm not angry with you, l only want you to return what you stole!

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:02.530
I'm sorry, I'm just cutting through.

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:11.040
No good, I'm just scaring everyone and destroying the forest...I can't reach them like this.

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:16.010
We finally lost that Mobile Suit!

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:19.850
What's with this!? These are just spare parts for mobile suits!

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:21.520
This is just a memory board!

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:23.730
Could this stuff be from Dianna Counter?

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:25.980
You mean those people from the truck team were the real thieves?

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:28.150
No, I don't think so...

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:29.820
So what is it, then?

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:32.450
They must be technicians from the Moonrace.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:33.820
What!?

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:36.240
There's no food...

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:38.120
Do we have to return them to the Soleil, then?

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:40.750
No! Even if we can't use it to eat...

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:43.750
l refuse to go crawling back to those damned elitists on Soleil's staff!

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:46.630
Good point, I don't want them working us into our grave.

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:49.300
I'll feed you if you want something.

00:15:50.980 --> 00:15:52.340
Big Sister Teteth!

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:53.430
It's you, Sis!

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:54.750
Is that you, Bruno?

00:15:57.410 --> 00:15:59.640
You're too much, Bruno!

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:03.140
Big Sister, why didn't you tell us that you'd come down to earth?

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:05.650
I never knew that you'd come here as well.

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:07.150
Eat up.

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:09.020
You bet I will!

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:12.280
Assassinate Queen Dianna!?

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:15.530
That's right, what do you boys think about it?

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:18.870
It really doesn't matter anymore if Dianna still exists or not.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:22.120
People will still hate us no matter where we go.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:25.540
But why would you take a filthy job like that, sis?

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:29.130
If I pull it off, I was promised the life of an honorary citizen.

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:34.220
And then, the three of us could live nice, quiet lives here on the earth.

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:37.510
I'd love to have a comfortable life like that.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:41.350
Three... meaning... us?

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.520
Who else would I be talking about?

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:45.520
Really!?

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:49.520
If Corin was asking us to risk our lives like that, I'd say "I'm sorry, I can't do it."

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:52.240
But for our big sister, we'd be willing to do anything!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.530
You know you can count on me!

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:58.850
The storm has kept most of her security personnel occupied, so we'll have to make our move now.

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:01.330
Okay! Keith's people have gone ahead...

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:04.320
And the Suicide Squad left as well.

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:08.540
Enemies detected?

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:11.040
The size and silhouette match the Gozzo...

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:14.090
Are those two Corin's followers?

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:18.350
Hey, Jacop-

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:19.470
What is it, Bruno?

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:23.430
Perhaps we can have another battle with that Gundam, now that Ms. Teteth is on our side!

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:25.640
Right now, we've got to reach the Soleil first.

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:28.150
Don't fall off, sis.

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:30.140
Go ahead.

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:36.240
What is that they're carrying?

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:38.160
Ms. Teteth?

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:40.780
They've captured Ms. Teteth Halleh!

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:48.160
Those mobile suits belong to...

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:50.840
At any rate, White Doll can jump further than they can!

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:52.330
I have to catch up!

00:17:58.490 --> 00:18:01.260
Teteth, I will save you!

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:03.340
Huh, that is...

00:18:04.070 --> 00:18:06.060
The mustached jerk!

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:08.980
We'll split up. I'll lead him off into the forest.

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:11.440
You try drawing him over toward the Soleil.

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:15.150
- Then what should I do? 
- I'll speak to you after that!

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:17.150
Be sure to finish Dianna off!

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:19.020
Understood, sister!

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.460
What? There's only one left?

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.590
Where'd the one holding Ms. Teteth go?

00:18:29.590 --> 00:18:31.740
It doesn't matter. I have to catch that one!

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:35.750
We're close to the Soleil!?

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:46.220
Do you still wish to go, Queen Dianna?

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:49.440
I have to comfort the Almaiya's soldiers.

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.940
Another storm might be coming soon, we'll have to hurry!

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:53.730
What's that?

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:55.850
Whose Squadron could that be?

00:18:57.790 --> 00:18:59.820
The White Mustached unit is coming!

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:01.660
It must be Loran!

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:03.950
Lieutenant Harry, protect Queen Dianna!

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:05.620
You don't have to tell me twice!

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:09.820
I'll escort Queen Dianna back to the Soleil! All of you, stop that girl in her tracks!

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:13.250
Lieutenant Harry, the important ceremony is going to start soon!

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:15.240
Please be careful!

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:16.760
Queen Dianna, come on!

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:18.050
I'd like to prevent the battle if possible!

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:19.830
I know that!

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:27.550
So now the Royal Guard is your enemy!

00:19:29.280 --> 00:19:32.140
The Royal Guard is here! Does that mean Queen Dianna is here as well?

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.900
Alright, big shot, it's your turn!

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:39.530
Mechanical Dolls, fighting in the air?

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:41.450
That's the White Doll!

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:44.450
Sir Guin, we can't allow Loran to battle against them!

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:47.540
That might be true, but what can we do?

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:50.540
Just let him see that we're on the battlefield!

00:19:54.390 --> 00:19:56.480
What's that mobile suit trying to do!?

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:58.840
Big Sister Teteth, I can see Dianna!

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:02.550
That Mobile Suit!

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:10.020
What's that mechanical doll!?

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:12.600
They're fighting amongst themselves? What's everyone doing!?

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:17.400
Pay attention!

00:20:20.170 --> 00:20:22.170
He aimed it at me!

00:20:22.170 --> 00:20:24.360
They want to kill Queen Dianna!

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:28.950
Loran fired at them?

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:30.620
Everyone, you must stop this!

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:33.290
Mobile Suits of both factions, please, back off!

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:34.250
That is...

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:35.920
Please, back away!

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:39.000
Soldier of the Royal Guard, do you intend to fight before an innocent woman?

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:41.420
Didn't you attack the Soleil first?

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:44.340
I'd never do such a thing!

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:47.720
Lady Kihel and Sir Guin are both here?

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:53.430
And here I thought they'd pull it off...

00:20:53.430 --> 00:20:56.230
Apparently, I'll still have to do it by myself.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:58.060
Oh well.

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:03.060
I can't see her after this humiliation...

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:05.530
We're just worthless piles of crap, aren't we?

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:09.330
That's not true. Dealing with hardships and losses is just a fact of life.

00:21:14.970 --> 00:21:18.670
The two of you must leave this area at once, Sir Guin Rhineford!

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:22.050
I would like to speak with Queen Dianna Soriel about the negotiations!

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:23.630
Please, return later.

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:28.680
Harry feels ashamed of the internal conflict he just witnessed...that's why...

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:32.720
This declaration you people have sent us... are you saying we have no say in the matter!?

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:39.650
Your invitation gives you all the information on the declaration that you'll need! Take the White Doll with you and come back later!

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:40.730
Sir Guin...

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:41.730
There's nothing I can do.

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:43.990
Someone attempted to assassinate Queen Dianna?

00:21:43.990 --> 00:21:45.650
Seems that way.

00:21:48.090 --> 00:21:51.120
Ms. Teteth, I chased after you because I thought you were kidnapped.

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:52.950
l was...

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:57.960
But those people fled and left me here after you defeated them.

00:21:57.960 --> 00:22:00.960
Please climb onto my hand! It's dangerous there!

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:03.420
You're so cute...

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:06.260
Well, we're friends who shared our time in a hot spring, right?

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:08.420
Loran, let's go!
- Right!

00:22:10.490 --> 00:22:12.970
Ms. Teteth is gone?

00:22:12.970 --> 00:22:15.630
Where did you go, Ms. Teteth!?

00:22:17.370 --> 00:22:19.550
Why... Ms. Teteth?

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b><i>Binetsu ga samenai mama</i></b>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b>As if unawoken from a slight fever</b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b><i>Utsumuku shounen no hitomi wa</i></b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b>The eyes of the boy hanging his head</b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b><i>Kokoro no umi mitsumete</i></b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b>Gaze upon the sea of his heart</b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b><i>Shizuka ni hohoenderu</i></b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b>And smile silently</b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b><i>Umare kuru mono kiete yuku mono</i></b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b>What is born, and what fades away</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b><i>Subete wa sadame no furiko no haba</i></b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b>Are but the sway of the pendulum of fate</b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b><i>Zasetsu no yami o tsukinuke mietekuru</i></b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b>Piercing the darkness of frustration, he begins to see it</b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b><i>Sore ga hikari no shinjitsu</i></b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b>It is the reality of the light</b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b><i>Yoake totomoni wasuresareru hoshi ni sasagu</i></b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b>Together with dawn, he gives an offering to the stars that will be forgotten</b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b><i>Shijou no ai wa chiisana sono te no naka ni aru</i></b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b>History's love lies in his tiny hands</b>

00:23:40.420 --> 00:23:41.990
<i>How could I not have noticed!?</i>

00:23:42.660 --> 00:23:47.690
<i>Milady Kihel and Queen Dianna had traded places...</i>

00:23:48.210 --> 00:23:52.360
<i>But still, the speech that Milady Kihel made to the Moonrace during the declaration-</i>

00:23:52.360 --> 00:23:57.410
<i>-cut the threads entrapping the two races. I was deeply touched by it.</i>

00:23:58.630 --> 00:24:01.220
<i>Next time... on </i>TURN-A GUNDAM...

00:24:01.220 --> 00:24:02.860
<i>Kihel and Dianna</i>

00:24:03.420 --> 00:24:05.910
"I can see where the wind will blow."

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:08.420
<b>Kihel and Dianna</b>
